      <description>&lt;p&gt;CFD от FEATool
&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.featool.com/tutorial/2016/11/14/Easy-Matlab-CFD-FeatFlow-external-CFD-solver-with-FEATool-integration&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://www.featool.com/tutorial/2016/11/14/Easy-Matlab-CFD-FeatFlow-external-CFD-solver-with-FEATool-integration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
